WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.797
On the simulated network,

00:00:01.877 --> 00:00:08.177
Neuroformer's attention reveals directed
connectivity and identifies the hub neurons,

00:00:08.257 --> 00:00:12.531
which plain correlation misses for lack of directionality.

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:17.861
On real cortex, it reproduces responses to gratings
and natural videos,

00:00:17.941 --> 00:00:23.190
with population predictions significantly beating a
GLM, p around 0.02.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:28.670
Fine-tuned to decode running, it reaches Pearson
correlations up to 0.97.
